package-architecture.dependency-graph:
@surte/design-system   (sin deps — base de todo)
        ↑
  @surte/core           (depende de design-system)
        ↑
  @surte/products       (depende de core + design-system)
  @surte/stock          (depende de core + design-system)
  @surte/expiration     (depende de core + design-system)
  @surte/sales          (depende de core + design-system)
  @surte/auth           (depende de core)
  @surte/reports        (depende de core + design-system)
        ↑
  apps/wholesale        (usa todos los packages necesarios)
  apps/bodega-simple    (usa subset: core + design-system + products)
  apps/playground       (usa SOLO design-system → Storybook)
